<view class="screen">
  <view class="eyebrow">MY BODY · MY PACE</view>
  <view class="title">用另一种方式，看见自己</view>
  <view class="muted">真人连续网格示意，非本人扫描。不能据此判断体脂或肌肉量。</view>
  <view class="model-card">
    <view class="model-label">{{activeLabel}}</view>
    <view class="stage">
      <view wx:if="{{showRuler}}" class="ruler"><view wx:for="{{ticks}}" wx:key="cm" class="tick" style="top:{{item.top}}%"><text>{{item.cm}}</text></view><view class="ruler-unit">cm</view></view>
      <view wx:if="{{showRuler}}" class="head-guide" style="top:{{headTop}}%"></view>
      <view class="floor"></view>
      <canvas id="bodyCanvas" type="webgl" class="body-canvas" catchtouchstart="touchStart" catchtouchmove="touchMove" catchtouchend="touchEnd" catchtouchcancel="touchEnd" />
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{renderError}}" class="notice">{{renderError}}</view>
    <view class="sex-switch"><button class="{{sex === 'male' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-sex="male" bindtap="setSex">男性轮廓</button><button class="{{sex === 'female' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-sex="female" bindtap="setSex">女性轮廓</button></view>
    <view class="gesture">{{autoRotate ? '约 20 秒匀速转一圈 · 触摸时暂停' : '自动旋转已暂停'}} · 双指缩放</view>
    <view class="views"><button class="secondary" data-angle="0" bindtap="view">正面</button><button class="secondary" data-angle="1.570796" bindtap="view">侧面</button><button class="secondary" data-angle="3.141593" bindtap="view">背面</button></view>
    <button class="rotation-toggle" bindtap="toggleAuto">{{autoRotate ? '暂停自动旋转' : '开启自动旋转'}}</button>
  </view>
  <view class="muted">{{note}} 未测量部位采用真人底模的默认比例，相同数据也可能对应不同的真实体型。</view>
  <view class="panel">
    <view class="heading">你的身体数据</view>
    <view class="muted">输入有效数值后自动预览：身高改变高矮，体重影响整体丰满度，腰围改变腰腹宽度与厚度。默认视角保持同一比例，方便比较。</view>
    <label class="field">身高（cm）<input type="digit" value="{{height}}" data-field="height" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如 175" maxlength="6" /></label>
    <label class="field">体重（kg）<input type="digit" value="{{weight}}" data-field="weight" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如 70（140 斤）" maxlength="6" /></label>
    <label class="field">腰围（cm，选填）<input type="digit" value="{{waist}}" data-field="waist" bindinput="input" placeholder="填写实测腰围，更贴近躯干轮廓" maxlength="6" /></label>
    <button class="primary space" bindtap="updateModel">更新体型</button>
    <button class="secondary space" bindtap="save">更新并保存快照</button>
    <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice space" aria-role="alert">{{message}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="panel">
    <view class="heading">我的体型快照</view>
    <view class="muted">仅保存在这台设备，暂不纳入云备份。保留最近 30 次；清除缓存会丢失。点击快照可切换查看轮廓。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}" class="muted space">还没有快照，先保存一次，作为之后的参考。</view>
    <button wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="index" class="snapshot" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="loadSnapshot"><view>{{item.label}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.height}} cm · {{item.weight}} kg{{item.waist === null ? '' : ' · 腰围 ' + item.waist + ' cm'}} →</view></button>
  </view>
</view>
